// Canonical source: a member with no access attribute is package access
// (thesis line 731), open to code of its own package: this unit declares
// package PkgSame, and its own top-level code reads Box's inner.
// Answer: 4
package PkgSame;
class Box : Object { int inner; section [public] { Box() { this.inner = 4; } } }
Box box = new Box();
return box.inner;
